1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:06,000
Imagine a longyi retailer in Yangon preparing for a busy sales week.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:10,500
Sixty pieces have been ordered. The payment has been sent.

3
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:13,200
Then the delivery runs into trouble.

4
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:16,800
Where is the stock? Who can take over?

5
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,500
And how much is still missing?

6
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:24,000
This is the problem Supply Link is built to solve.

7
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:29,981
Introducing Supply Link by Ocean Pride: a smart delivery recovery

8
00:00:29,981 --> 00:00:33,486
solution. It connects supplier headquarters, branches, drivers, and

9
00:00:33,486 --> 00:00:38,305
retailers in one coordinated workflow. From the first order to the

10
00:00:38,305 --> 00:00:43,124
final receipt, every team can see the information needed to move

11
00:00:43,124 --> 00:00:44,000
fulfilment forward.

12
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:49,090
The journey starts in the retailer portal.

13
00:00:49,090 --> 00:00:54,075
Browse the longyi catalog, compare normal and premium styles, and

14
00:00:54,075 --> 00:00:59,558
choose quantities for the shop. The cart brings every selected style

15
00:00:59,558 --> 00:01:03,546
together. Before ordering, review the receiver, delivery address,

16
00:01:03,546 --> 00:01:08,531
shipping charge, and complete total. Then transfer the full amount

17
00:01:08,531 --> 00:01:13,018
using the supplier's payment instructions and upload payment evidence.

18
00:01:13,018 --> 00:01:17,504
Headquarters verifies the actual payment before confirming the order

19
00:01:17,504 --> 00:01:19,000
and reserving stock.

20
00:01:20,600 --> 00:01:24,532
Headquarters assigns an approved driver and prepares the delivery.

21
00:01:24,532 --> 00:01:27,591
Physical pickup is recorded separately from dispatch.

22
00:01:27,591 --> 00:01:31,960
During delivery, the driver can share location while the delivery

23
00:01:31,960 --> 00:01:36,329
page stays open. Headquarters and the ordering retailer can follow

24
00:01:36,329 --> 00:01:39,825
the road route, estimated driving time, and distance.

25
00:01:39,825 --> 00:01:44,194
The map supports visibility, while handover and receipt remain explicit

26
00:01:44,194 --> 00:01:49,000
confirmations. A location pin alone never marks the goods as received.

27
00:01:50,600 --> 00:01:54,093
Now imagine the original delivery cannot continue.

28
00:01:54,093 --> 00:01:59,082
Headquarters places the order on hold and records the issue.

29
00:01:59,082 --> 00:02:03,573
Before arranging a replacement, the original consignment must be

30
00:02:03,573 --> 00:02:08,064
resolved. Supply Link then helps headquarters coordinate a suitable

31
00:02:08,064 --> 00:02:11,557
branch using its dedicated wholesale backup reserve.

32
00:02:11,557 --> 00:02:17,045
Retail stock stays separate. In our demo, the retailer ordered sixty

33
00:02:17,045 --> 00:02:21,037
longyi pieces, but the branch can supply forty.

34
00:02:21,037 --> 00:02:25,528
Headquarters requests that first phase. Branch staff accept, reserve

35
00:02:25,528 --> 00:02:29,021
the selected stock, and arrange their driver.

36
00:02:29,021 --> 00:02:34,010
The retailer keeps the same order reference and agreed prices.

37
00:02:34,010 --> 00:02:38,002
Recovery becomes a visible sequence of responsibilities, quantities,

38
00:02:38,002 --> 00:02:39,000
and confirmations.

39
00:02:40,600 --> 00:02:45,565
After the first delivery, Supply Link shows forty of sixty pieces

40
00:02:45,565 --> 00:02:49,627
received, with twenty remaining. Headquarters can arrange the outstanding

41
00:02:49,627 --> 00:02:53,689
twenty from its own stock or another suitable branch.

42
00:02:53,689 --> 00:02:56,849
Each phase keeps its own delivery progress.

43
00:02:56,849 --> 00:03:00,911
Every delivery requires driver handover and retailer receipt confirmation.

44
00:03:00,911 --> 00:03:05,876
Only after all pieces are accounted for, with no unresolved issue,

45
00:03:05,876 --> 00:03:10,841
does the order become Done. The completed order records one wholesale

46
00:03:10,841 --> 00:03:14,000
sale, even when fulfilment takes multiple deliveries.

47
00:03:15,600 --> 00:03:19,574
Stock Planning helps headquarters prepare for the next disruption.

48
00:03:19,574 --> 00:03:23,547
Review backup availability, set targets, and respond to low-stock

49
00:03:23,547 --> 00:03:27,079
alerts. Where sufficient emergency-order and refill history exists,

50
00:03:27,079 --> 00:03:29,728
evidence-based recommendations support target decisions. Optional

51
00:03:29,728 --> 00:03:32,377
AI explanations clarify the saved figures.

52
00:03:32,377 --> 00:03:36,351
Headquarters stays in control, and incoming stock becomes available

53
00:03:36,351 --> 00:03:39,000
only after physical receipt is confirmed.

54
00:03:40,600 --> 00:03:44,600
For retailers, clearer progress. For branches, a defined backup role.

55
00:03:44,600 --> 00:03:47,800
For drivers, focused delivery work. For headquarters, coordinated

56
00:03:47,800 --> 00:03:51,800
recovery and accountable stock. We invite supplier partners to pilot

57
00:03:51,800 --> 00:03:54,200
the workflow and measure the results.

58
00:03:54,200 --> 00:03:57,400
Supply Link by Ocean Pride. Every order connected.

59
00:03:57,400 --> 00:03:59,000
Every piece accounted for.
